* HyRes topology for adducts and modified residues (dyes on Cys / RNA ends)
* use with top_hyres_mix.inp, top_RNA_mix.inp and top_metabolome.inp; utils.load_ff('Adduct')
* new residue names must also be added to GenPsf.aas (protein) or GenPsf.rnas (RNA)
*
   20    1

!## dye bead types
MASS   244 XAN   36.033   ! xanthene centre
MASS   245 XAR   26.038   ! dye aromatic ring
MASS   246 XAC   26.038   ! Cy3B aromatic ring
MASS   247 XAF   26.038   ! CF660R aromatic ring
MASS   248 XQN   43.069   ! CF660R N(+)-ethyl (QdK, larger, no cation-pi)
MASS   610 M3L   50.00    ! C2R linker amide
MASS   612 A5L   56.108   ! CF660R butyl
MASS   614 A3S   43.089   ! legacy, unused


DECL -C
DECL -O
DECL +N
DECL +H
DECL +CA
DECL +EO
DECL -EO
DECL +P
DECL +C1
DECL +C2
DECL -P
DECL -C1
DECL -C2

AUTOGENERATE DIHE
DEFA FIRS NTER LAST CTER

